  "supersessions": [
    {"id":"SUP-001","ledgerOrdinal":1,"sourceOutcomeIds":["SPEC-009","SPEC-010","CORR-HF-039","CORR-HF-061"],"feedbackIds":["HF-039","HF-061"],"canonicalText":"`DEC-07`: grenade families are now `frag`, `smoke`, `flash`, `semtex`; still exactly one selected, one spawned, cap one, kills do not replenish, the valid corpse-ammo-pickup transaction restores exactly one."},
    {"id":"SUP-002","ledgerOrdinal":2,"sourceOutcomeIds":["CORR-HF-016"],"feedbackIds":["HF-016"],"canonicalText":"`DEC-13`: `deathClearsUnconsumedRewards` is `false`; progress remains per-life and resets on death; earned unconsumed rewards remain until consumed or match epoch end."},
    {"id":"SUP-003","ledgerOrdinal":3,"sourceOutcomeIds":["SPEC-025","CORR-HF-027"],"feedbackIds":["HF-027"],"canonicalText":"Human-facing graphics presets supersede the earlier four-label surface: `Quality`, `Performance`, `Custom`. Internal quality tiers may exist only as resolved settings/benchmarks, not as a contradictory top-level choice."},
    {"id":"SUP-004","ledgerOrdinal":4,"sourceOutcomeIds":["SPEC-010","CORR-HF-020"],"feedbackIds":["HF-020"],"canonicalText":"`DEC-14` is not weakened by the request for a stronger flash. The effect is one strong bounded onset plus monotonic recovery, never a repeated full-screen strobe; reduced-sensory precedence and peak-limited audio remain mandatory."},
    {"id":"SUP-005","ledgerOrdinal":5,"sourceOutcomeIds":["CORR-HF-069"],"feedbackIds":["HF-069"],"canonicalText":"Pass 65 owner HITL will apply only to a new immutable replacement `S0`; the failed `ec8a55f…` preview cannot be retrospectively approved after runtime edits."},
    {"id":"SUP-006","ledgerOrdinal":6,"sourceOutcomeIds":["SPEC-025","CORR-HF-053"],"feedbackIds":["HF-053"],"canonicalText":"Renderer quality profiles are presentation-only. They may reduce texture resolution, shadow/particle/decal/LOD budgets or non-authoritative minor debris, but may not remove/substitute semantic structures while retaining their colliders, or otherwise change cover, LOS, navigation, movement, ballistics or target visibility."},
    {"id":"SUP-007","ledgerOrdinal":7,"sourceOutcomeIds":["SPEC-039","CORR-HF-045"],"feedbackIds":["HF-045"],"canonicalText":"Every support asset declares and validates its modelling-axis conversion once. Route code uses the canonical forward axis; ad-hoc sign flips in individual abilities are forbidden."},
    {"id":"SUP-008","ledgerOrdinal":8,"sourceOutcomeIds":["SPEC-043","SPEC-044","CORR-HF-048","CORR-HF-049","CORR-HF-055"],"feedbackIds":["HF-048","HF-049","HF-055"],"canonicalText":"Drone visual and weapon identity are shared by catalog projection, not copy-pasted: Swarm and standalone variants reference the same asset family and `DroneGunProfileId`; variant policy may change control mode, reserve and lifetime only where already frozen."},
    {"id":"SUP-009","ledgerOrdinal":9,"sourceOutcomeIds":["CORR-HF-056"],"feedbackIds":["HF-056"],"canonicalText":"Runtime map previews supersede the earlier live-render interpretation of R112–R114: authored paths remain offline video-generation inputs and evidence, while the shipped menu plays prerecorded compressed media and submits no gameplay frames."},
    {"id":"SUP-010","ledgerOrdinal":10,"sourceOutcomeIds":["CORR-HF-062"],"feedbackIds":["HF-062"],"canonicalText":"Atomic Acres reinforcement cadence is one added opponent per ten defeated bots, starting from the existing two and capped at six; the old fifth-death wording is retired."},
    {"id":"SUP-011","ledgerOrdinal":11,"sourceOutcomeIds":["CORR-HF-068"],"feedbackIds":["HF-068"],"canonicalText":"Support HUD damage feedback is target-bound world projection. Centre-reticle damage numbers remain valid for the player's own camera-centred firearm hit only, not remote/AI support damage."}
  ],
